    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d554">

                <pb facs="0772" n="670" xml:id="pg670"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">765.84/1720: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Ethiopia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Engert</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Addis Ababa</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1935-10-10T15:00:00+02:35">October 10, 1935—3
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 8:40 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>121. Italian Minister informs me that he received this morning a note from the
                    Ethiopian Government requesting him to make preparations for his early
                    departure. He is accused of using his radio for transmission in violation of his
                    promise not to do so. Vinci denies the accusation categorically and states that
                    since October 3 he has used it only for the reception of messages about which
                    nothing had been said.</p>
                <p>He has just shown me his orders from Rome to depart with his personnel but
                    without any indication as to which Legation would be requested to look after
                    Italian interests.</p>
                <p>Since my 112, October 5, 2 p.m., one more Italian Consul has arrived safely and
                    without the slightest incident. Only one now remains and the Minister will
                    endeavor to await his arrival too.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Engert</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
